                                Test32
                                ------

  Test for the analysis category:
  - for testing multiple file output
  Responsible: Ivana Hrivnacova, IPN Orsay

  This test uses the scenario as defined in basic/B4 example
  with added use-cases for testing analysis

  Run command:
  ./test08  -m run-xyz.mac

  Macros:
  run-xyz.mac, xyz = csv, hdf5, root, xml
    - run with the default output type 'xyz', saving selected objects
      with other output types
  run-root-merge.mac
    - macro for run with default output type 'root'
      with activated merging
  set-files.mac
    - parameterised macro called from run-xyz.mac
      for setting all output files names

